:: Flee

<<set $story_progress -= roll_dice(2, 6, +3)>>You'd rather not face such dangers right now. Best to retrace your steps, even at the cost of losing progress. There must be some other way forward. A safer one.

@@text-align:center;
<<if $story_progress > 0>>
 [[Retreat, for now -> Respite]]
<<else>>
 [[Retreat, for now -> A doorway too far]]
<</if>>
@@
